<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>What logged-out visitors now see</strong></p>
<ul dir="ltr">
<li>A cover page with a â€œJOIN AFRICAâ€™S TASK MARKETPLACEâ€ label, the headline, and <strong>Join free</strong> and <strong>Log in</strong> buttons.</li>
<li>Free / Local / Safe highlights, the Conversations, How it works and Trust &amp; safety sections, and a closing â€œJoin SkyNetworks free â†’â€ button.</li>
