<li>Sign up and Log in at the top of every screen.</li>
<li>No task list and no map. Tapping Browse tasks opens sign-up instead.</li>
</ul>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>What logged-in users see:</strong> the inside view you already have (greeting, My tasks, My offers, Notifications, filters, list and map), unchanged.</p>
<p dir="ltr"><strong>Why the cover page never showed on a real phone:</strong> your CSS had an old rule that hides the whole cover page and the Sign up / Log in buttons on screens narrower than 680px. In Desktop site mode that rule doesnâ€™t fire, so you saw the page as in your screenshots. I scoped that rule to logged-in users only, so the cover page now shows on phones.</p>
<p dir="ltr" data-cds-heading=""><strong>To put it live</strong></p>
<ol dir="ltr">
<li>Replace <code dir="ltr">index.html</code> in your GitHub repo with this file. Leave <code dir="ltr">supabase-config.js</code> as it is.</li>
<li>Turn Desktop site off in Chrome and reload.</li>
</ol>
<p dir="ltr">I tested it in a browser with Supabase simulated, since I canâ€™t log in to your real project. The logged-out view, the Join free and Log in buttons, and the logged-in switch all worked, with no script errors. Please check real sign-up and login on your site.</p>
<p dir="ltr">On phones the map picture in the hero is hidden, as it was before, to keep the cover page short. Say if you want it back.</p></div></div><div data-testid="file-card-stack" class="flex flex-col gap-2 ps-[var(--msg-block-inset,0.5rem)]"><div data-transcript-stays-put=""><div data-cds="Card" data-testid="file-card-block" data-file-row-card="" data-cds-bubble-stack-item="" class="group/card relative isolate flex flex-col rounded-card after:pointer-events-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-[inherit] after:shadow-card-ring after:content-[''] has-[[data-cds=CardLink]:focus-visible]:after:shadow-focus stacks:has-[[data-cds=CardLink]]:hover:[&amp;&gt;.cds-card-fill:not(.bg-surface-2)]:[--cds-surface-2:var(--cds-fizzy-lake-color-card-hover)] w-full max-w-130"><span aria-hidden="true" class="cds-card-fill pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 -z-[1] m-0 rounded-[inherit] text-tint-yellow bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_4%,var(--cds-surface-1))] dark:bg-[color-mix(in_srgb,currentColor_8%,var(--cds-surface-1))]"></span><div data-cds-card-body="" class="cds-card-body flex min-h-0 flex-1 flex-col self-stretch [gap:inherit] [align-items:inherit] [justify-content:inherit] rounded-[inherit] p-lg"><div class="flex items-center font-sans"><div class="flex min-w-0 flex-1 items-center gap-sm"><span aria-hidden="true" class="flex size-[calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-chip text-tint-yellow bg-tint-yellow"><span data-cds="Icon" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size: calc(1.25rem * var(--cds-rem-scale, 1)); font-weight: 433.3;">î‚‚</span></span><div class="flex h-[calc(2rem*var(--cds-rem-scale,1))] min-w-0 flex-1 flex-col justify-center"><div class="shrink-0 text-heading font-medium truncate text-primary"><span data-cds="CardLink" role="button" tabindex="0" data-testid="file-card-open" aria-current="true" aria-label="View Index" class="cds-reset outline-none after:absolute after:inset-0 after:rounded-card after:content