<main id="home">
<section class="hero"><div class="hero-copy"><span class="eyebrow">JOIN AFRICAâ€™S TASK MARKETPLACE</span><h1>Get more done with <em>SkyNetworks</em></h1><p>Post any task, get offers from trusted local people, and agree the work â€” all in one place.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><button class="primary" id="heroPost">Join free</button><button class="secondary" id="heroLogin" type="button">Log in</button></div><ul class="hero-stats"><li><b>Free</b><span>to post a task</span></li><li><b>Local</b><span>people near you</span></li><li><b>Safe</b><span>contact-protected chat</span></li></ul></div>
