<section class="conversation-intro" id="conversations"><div><div class="eyebrow">BUILT-IN CUSTOMER &amp; PROVIDER MESSAGING</div><h2>Conversations that move work forward</h2><p>Ask general questions in the public task thread. When the customer selects a provider, a private conversation opens for detailed arrangements.</p><div class="section-cta"><button type="button" class="primary small" data-go="browse">Join a discussion</button><button type="button" class="outline" data-go="post">Post a task</button></div></div><div class="conversation-rules"><div><b>01 Â· Public task discussion</b><span>Visible to signed-in marketplace members. Contact details and personal links are blocked.</span></div><div><b>02 Â· Private negotiation</b><span>Available to the customer and selected provider only, after an offer is accepted.</span></div></div></section>
<section class="how" id="how"><div class="eyebrow">SIMPLE FROM START TO FINISH</div><h2>A better way to get work done</h2><div class="steps"><article><span>01</span><div class="step-icon">âœ</div><h3>Post or discover</h3><p>Describe the task, set a budget and choose a general location.</p></article><article><span>02</span><div class="step-icon">ðŸ’¬</div><h3>Discuss publicly</h3><p>Ask questions and compare offers without exposing private contacts.</p></article><article><span>03</span><div class="step-icon">ðŸ¤</div><h3>Agree privately</h3><p>The customer accepts an offer to open a private conversation with that provider.</p></article><article><span>04</span><div class="step-icon">â˜…</div><h3>Complete &amp; review</h3><p>Confirm completion and leave a review to build trust.</p></article></div><div class="section-cta center"><button type="button" class="primary" data-go="post">Post a task</button><button type="button" class="outline" data-go="browse">Browse tasks</button></div></section>
<section class="trust" id="safety"><div><div class="eyebrow">TRUST IS THE FOUNDATION</div><h2>Your work. Your data.<br><em>Your control.</em></h2><p>Public contact filtering is applied in the browser and reinforced by a database trigger after you install the supplied SQL update. No automated filter catches every possible attempt, so users can also report suspicious content.</p><a href="https://www.claudeusercontent.com/?domain=claude.ai&amp;parentOrigin=https%3A%2F%2Fclaude.ai&amp;errorReportingMode=parent&amp;formattedSpreadsheets=true&amp;contentType=text%2Fhtml#terms" class="underlink">Read platform rules â†’</a></div><div class="trust-cards"><article><b>â—‰ Public by design</b><p>Phone numbers, emails, social handles, personal links, payment details and exact addresses are not allowed in public messages.</p></article><article><b>â–£ Private when selected</b><p>Private chat is restricted to the task owner and the provider whose offer was accepted.</p></article><article><b>â™¢ Company support</b><p>For platform support, contact <a href="mailto:networke@gmail.com">networke@gmail.com</a>.</p></article></div></section>
<section class="cta"><div><span class="eyebrow">YOUR NEXT OPPORTUNITY STARTS HERE</span><h2>Ready to make something happen?</h2><p>Post a task or put your skills in front of people who need them.</p></div><button class="primary" id="ctaPost">Join SkyNetworks free â†’</button></section>
<section class="terms" id="terms"><div><div class="eyebrow">CLEAR EXPECTATIONS</div><h2>Terms &amp; conditions</h2><p class="muted">This is a product starter policy, not legal advice. Obtain local legal review before commercial launch.</p></div><div class="terms-grid"><article><h3>1. Platform role</h3><p>SkyNetworks connects customers and independent providers. Users are responsible for agreeing the scope and terms of work.</p></article><article><h3>2. Fees &amp; payments</h3><p>Any platform fee and payment terms must be shown before confirmation. This version does not process payments.</p></article><article><h3>3. Contact details</h3><p>Do not place personal contacts, external links, payment credentials or exact addresses in public content.</p></article><article><h3>4. Privacy</h3><p>Use only necessary information. Private conversations are limited to task participants and may be subject to disclosed lawful safety review.</p></article><article><h3>5. Disputes</h3><p>Keep scope, price and milestones in platform records. A formal dispute and refund process must be introduced before payments launch.</p></article><article><h3>6. Safety</h3><p>Report fraud, harassment or unsafe requests. SkyNetworks may restrict accounts for serious or repeated violations.</p></article></div></section>
